---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: About
description: Why Net Cloud Edge exists, and who we've built it for.
---
{% from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}

<section class="bg-surface py-14 sm:py-20">
  <div class="section-container">
    {% set crumbs = [{ label: "Home", url: "/" }, { label: "About" }] %}
    {% include "partials/breadcrumb.njk" %}
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold text-ink mt-4">About Us</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-lg text-ink/65 max-w-xl">Recruiting built around people, not pipelines.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="section-container">
    <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center gap-10 lg:gap-16">
      <div class="lg:w-1/2">
        <div class="aspect-[4/3] rounded-3xl bg-surface flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
          <svg class="w-1/2 h-1/2 text-brand/25" viewBox="0 0 200 200" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="30" y="30" width="140" height="140" rx="24"/>
            <path d="M60 100h80M100 60v80" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:w-1/2">
        <p class="eyebrow">Our story</p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold text-ink mt-2">Started from a bad job search</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 text-ink/70 leading-relaxed">
          We started this firm after watching too many good candidates lose good opportunities to slow processes, vague feedback, and job boards that treat people like line items. At the same time, we watched employers struggle to fill roles with anyone but the loudest applicant, not the right one.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 font-display text-xl text-ink border-l-4 border-accent pl-5 italic">
          "A placement should feel like a match, not a transaction."
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-ink/70 leading-relaxed">
          Today we work both sides of that gap — helping students and professionals land roles that fit, and helping employers hire people who'll stay.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-surface">
  <div class="section-container">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mb-12">
      <p class="eyebrow">What we stand for</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold text-ink mt-2">Mission & values</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      {% set values = [
        { icon: "shield", title: "Integrity", text: "We tell candidates and employers the truth, even when it's not the easy answer." },
        { icon: "heart", title: "Candidate-First", text: "A placement is only good if it's good for the person taking it." },
        { icon: "bolt", title: "Speed", text: "Good process shouldn't be slow — we move quickly without cutting corners." },
        { icon: "users", title: "Long-Term Partnerships", text: "We measure success by who's still placed a year later, not just the offer." }
      ] %}
      {% for value in values %}
      <div class="bg-paper rounded-2xl p-6">
        <span class="flex items-center justify-center w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-surface text-brand">{{ icon(value.icon, "w-5 h-5") }}</span>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-ink mt-4">{{ value.title }}</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink/65 leading-relaxed">{{ value.text }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/stat-counter.njk" %}

<section class="py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="section-container">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mb-12">
      <p class="eyebrow">Trust</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold text-ink mt-2">Why students & professionals trust us</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-surface rounded-2xl p-8 sm:p-10">
        <span class="flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-paper text-brand">{{ icon("users", "w-6 h-6") }}</span>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink mt-6">If you're starting out</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-ink/65 leading-relaxed">We've placed thousands of first-time candidates who didn't know where to start — and treated every one like the placement mattered.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-surface rounded-2xl p-8 sm:p-10">
        <span class="flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-paper text-brand">{{ icon("briefcase", "w-6 h-6") }}</span>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink mt-6">If you're switching or hiring</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-ink/65 leading-relaxed">Whether you're moving on from a role or trying to fill one, we work from the same playbook: understand the fit before we make the match.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set ctaHeadline = "Want to know more?" %}
{% set ctaSubtext = "Let's talk about where you're headed, or who you're hiring for." %}
{% set ctaLabel = "Let's Talk" %}
{% set ctaHref = "/contact/" %}
{% set ctaVariant = "brand" %}
{% include "partials/cta-section.njk" %}
